1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
(Alice) [happily] 大家早安

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,200
(Alice) [happily] 今天會議的重點有三個

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,000
(Alice) [laughter]

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,000
(Bob) [angrily] 我有不同意見

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
(Unknown) Excuse me, can I add something?

